      "writtenOn": "2020-09-08T18:37:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We shouldn\u0027t need the @UnsupportedAppUsage annotation on any of these because they are new APIs. This annotation would allow the method to be called by 3P apps via reflection. They also require the BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED permission, so even if 3P apps call them, they would fail the permission check. We should instead make these @SystemApi which would allow them to be accessed by GMS, but not by 3P apps.",
      "revId": "0454796213a57056daeb88624db9e661fa3c4a62",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
